  "architecture_decision": "Quality issues and match candidates remain reviewable records. Exact matching can create deterministic review candidates; fuzzy similarity can only create a REVIEW candidate with evidence and never mutates canonical records. An explicitly approved candidate is merged atomically by a steward service that redirects related links, preserves aliases/source lineage/suppression, archives the duplicate, and records before/after audit evidence.",
